    "aEWmrG5CfR": "That's not a chicken.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockAnimal.cs#L89
    "MBkkio0DCs": "I wonder if it's lost and can't find its way home...  It seems distressed.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockAnimal.cs#L89
    "fpgy1f2A0N": "Maybe a Junimo Portal would help it find its way home.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockAnimal.cs#L131
    "cNwHdGjcxq": "That wasn't a chicken...  was it?$2#$b#Your grandfather had some little houses like that on his farm.  He said they were for his 'helpers'.  But as he declined, he was prone to say, well, a lot of stuff....$2#$b#I suppose I caught a glimpse of them from time to time, but, well...  I think I'm more comfortable not seeing them.$3#$b#You say they're good creatures?  Well...  Okay.  *Something* was sure keeping that farm in trim when your Grandad was declining.$2#$b#I suppose everybody needs a little magic in their lives from time to time.$0",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockAnimal.cs#L209
    "Giekfc5hqc": "Thank you for helping our friend get home...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockAnimal.cs#L209
    "aLauGiQih1": "I can help you, like I helped your Grandfather...",

