    "fDqztL3Gre": "Enter the Cindersap Forest during the day with a Junimo Portal in your inventory.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockAnimal.cs#L72
    "QgTycdlGVm": "Junimos will work with animal-related machines like cheese presses, looms and mayonnaise machines.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockCropMachines.cs#L173
    "UrkHLT1Pgx": "Crops Junimo",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockCropMachines.cs#L114
    "uScnjVETFm": "We love giant crops!  Please keep growing them!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockCropMachines.cs#L114
    "x0JObvTAuL": "One of us will come and help with your kegs, casks and preserves jars if you connect them to a portal!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockCropMachines.cs#L136
    "uB3l5RAtZR": "Did you ever see the giant crops your Granddad used to grow?  Crazy big pumpkins.#$b#Abby campaigned for me to buy one every year.  I think she wanted me to buy one so she could carve out a house for herself.$1",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockCropMachines.cs#L145
    "RWSgCcWL4J": "Has Abby been needling you about growing giant pumpkins?$4#$b#Don't do it, really, there's no money in it.  Quantity is good, sure, but the quality isn't.$2#$b#Your grandpa grew them in his declining years in particular.  He said 'my helpers like them'.  Not sure what he meant by that, but he really enjoyed them that made it worth it to him!$1",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockCropMachines.cs#L154
    "tPcZFc86j4": "When you were a kid visiting the farm, did you ever see any of the giant cauliflowers that your grandpa grew?  I mean huge!  Like way huge!$1#$b#I only got to see them once that I can recall when my Mom took me down there one afternoon.#$b#I climbed one like a tree and my Mom got all worried.#$b#Your grandad fished me down and told my mom not to worry because magical creatures would protect me.#$b#I don't know why, I guess it's because I was just a kid, but I felt really special for a long time after that day.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockCropMachines.cs#L163
    "JVwYRHGRNB": "Your grandad used to grow these gigantic pumpkins.  I totally wanted to carve one of those things.$1#$b#But my mom wouldn't buy one and your grandad invented this cock&bull story about magical creatures.$5#$b#Didn't he know I was too old for stories like that?  Meh.  I guess I should cut him slack for being old and senile.$2#$b#So...  Do you want to hear about any more of my first-world problems?$2",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockCropMachines.cs#L173
    "CjipSJii1D": "Junimos will work with crop-related machines like Kegs",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L51
    "MdQHomtqLT": "Enables the fishing Junimo - Enables the Junimo for handling fishing things with or without having done the quest.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L203
    "uaY6CDf9CM": "{{arg0}} of 6 teleported",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L248
    "zHGVhw2toA": "You've made a new Junimo friend that will help with traps and fishing-related machines",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L410
    "u5Xs3tgNPi": "@!  I'm so glad you came!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L410
    "BpE8De3Ya3": "Please come to the mines with me.  There's something I have to show you!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L410
    "ktA1j1jHzJ": "I had been having these recurring dreams...  In it, there was somebody like me, but wasn't me...  You know how dreams are.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L410
    "Ww5peBcXuE": "Anyway, this other me was at a pool, deep in a cave.  It was filled with litter, but the whole community was pitching in to clean it up.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L410
    "uTDMjRgVJy": "They cleaned it, but there were no fish in it anymore, which made the other me sad.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L410
    "CsYnBwJciE": "But then a fish tank appeared!  And then fish started appearing in the fish tank, and the other me started netting them out and releasing them into the pond!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L410
    "deAMOx4enW": "As to what happened next, well, you'd best see for yourself.  Please take the elevator down to 60.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L455
    "kQGrrfg5xP": "It was just a dream, I thought, but the next night I dreamt the same thing, so I just had to come down here.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L455
    "nqawfSl7dr": "Look at this!  The fish tank from my dream!  Where did that come from?",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L455
    "vfyxUCodZX": "Well, the tank was empty, and I decided I'd try putting a fish in there, so I caught a ghostfish and put it in there.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L455
    "laaojosbjM": "AND IT DISAPPEARED!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L455
    "fCtFLI4LeZ": "Poof!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L455
    "fMkItbauLZ": "Gone!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L455
    "G2Ps8uc6RK": "So I put in another, and it disappeared too!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L455
    "Ub8dFjg0BF": "Is it going to the world in my dream?  I don't know, but after about half a dozen fish went in there they stopped disappearing.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L455
    "ZWLPDQQZ62": "...But the tank is still here...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L455
    "vV1ZQpSDhe": "I see some smaller fish darting around in the pool, but I haven't been able to land any of them.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L455
    "OxjKrcriFv": "You're the only one that can help since you've got the skill, the equipment and can handle yourself this deep in the mine.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L455
    "OM9yp5ibnu": "Could you try and catch some of those little fish and put them in the tank and see what happens?",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L455
    "bJtL0fPDHo": "I'm afraid I've got to leave you to it.  I know it could take a while to catch them and I...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L455
    "mgTWGTTK0z": "Well, I've got a lot to think about.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L393
    "OQE6YOuLhT": "Fishing Junimo",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L393
    "rjyBT2vaWU": "Junimos will work with fishing-related machines like crab pots and recycling machines.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L358
    "QtyXFFxBHc": "Find Linus At His Tent",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L358
    "a3sOXMDZvV": "Linus said he had something he needed your help with.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L358
