    "ruSiyojzaq": "I'm still having those dreams.  The other me...  who seems less and less like me each night, keeps checking that fish tank in his world.  He's disappointed and puzzled.#$b#I'm pretty puzzled too.  But I'm glad you're working on it.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L377
    "pgldaGwn6v": "Did you finish collecting those fish?  I'm betting you have.  I had one last dream, where the fish were released and the tank disappeared.#$b#You know, one of the reasons I adopted my, uh...  lifestyle is that I was, well, not so stable in the head.#$b#And sometimes angry.  That was the part that made me take what most would regard as a drastic lifestyle change.#$b#But I've never felt saner.  At least up until these dreams started happening.#$b#But in these visions there is nothing like anger, so, well, that's good.#$b#But I still hope they go away.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockFishing.cs#L385
    "Niz2hChPAS": "Hey I just read a paper written by one of my old college buddies on habitat restoration of an underground pool populated with Ghostfish and Ice Pips!$1#$b#I'm told we have such a cavern deep in the mines.  Perhaps you could take me to it one day.#$b#Funny, the paper didn't specify where he got the fish to repopulate from...$3",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L207
    "TPJNvwmuSR": "Thx!  Bai!!!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L207
    "jDjeyijfdQ": "The giant trees were cut down to make ships and buildings and other wonderful things...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L207
    "XEBSO9uSW8": "...but they cut like there would always be more, until they cut down the last one.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L207
    "eFJvx689nC": "You will be wiser.  We will help.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L230
    "gZocCqhgXS": "Welcome!  You're just in time!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L230
    "RrI5xa73j3": "I hiked the back-woods trail today.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L230
    "KaRNxr3YIH": "It can be a bit treacherous at my age...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L230
    "HfsVff5XXS": "But the view of the desert is breathtaking.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L230
    "LqwpJR5PXw": "I picked a few wild mushrooms and herbs along the way.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L230
    "wbswl1MG0p": "Dinner is served!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L230
    "MwzKrmro2h": "What do you think?",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L230
    "YSO3qN9j4O": "I'm glad you like it.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L230
    "LsnsBa8pGp": "You know, when people see you talking to the trees, well...  They tend to think you're crazy.$2",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L230
    "GNQsVZOcgc": "But when you hear the trees talking *to* *you*, then... well...#$b#Then maybe they're right.$2",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L230
    "urrMKMGmv7": "Last night I dreamt I saw what these trees looked like before they were cut...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L230
    "MS7oJsd5r6": "Then, the vision pivoted to your farm; your farm when those big stumps and logs were standing trees...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L230
    "IdMfVTp1WE": "I found these seeds in my tent as I was stepping out this morning.#$b#I guess I tracked them in last night.  They're usually not so easy to find.  Here.  I think they're meant for you.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L230
    "kzV8AFCjUA": "I'm glad you're the sort of friend that doesn't mind listening to the ravings of a crazy old man.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L230
    "m2ysp95THa": "Well...  It's getting late.  You should get back to your farm and I should crawl into my tent.#$b#I plan on breaking camp in the morning and making the hike up to the mountain.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L230
    "PaVvrqHeAU": "Do the trees talk to you too?",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L230
    "OGGOrzoslh": "Hm.  Perhaps it's best not to answer that one...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L189
    "X4F31p1lvR": "Forestry Junimo",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L189
    "LqRR667ROW": "Junimos will work with foraging-related machines like tappers and mushroom logs",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L172
    "DMi7QNRB5C": "Grow a Mystic Tree",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L172
    "qeDVDSoV4F": "Linus gave you some tree seeds...  Do the Junimos talk to him too?",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L172
    "XjovUPUpOK": "Grow a Mystic Tree and 2 Mahogony Trees to adulthood on your farm.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L173
    "fXwO7pRsAh": "Meet Linus In The Secret Woods",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L173
    "oD0YBwmUKy": "Have dinner with Linus in the Secret Woods",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L173
    "dtOYnKDbnP": "Enter the secret woods on a sunny day between 6 and 11pm.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L181
    "IrsTfAhj4J": "@,^How are you doing?  I've decided to spend a night or two in the deep woods, west of Marnie's ranch.  Would you care to share a meal in the wild with me? ^   -Linus",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockForest.cs#L181
    "mGm0o8rO1f": "Meet at Linus' camp in the woods",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockMiner.cs#L46
    "iqYpoWQEl8": "Give the strange orb to the host player - only the host can advance this quest.  (Put it in a chest for them)",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockMiner.cs#L120
    "gmlJQdk8lf": "a strange faintly glowing orb",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockMiner.cs#L120
    "WCZNY4BDTA": "It looks vaguely magical. It's quite hard and smooth.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockMiner.cs#L130
    "T7QBZYZe9a": "My dear boy...^My beloved grand-daughter...#$b#I am sorry to come to you like this, but I had to thank you for rescuing my dear Junimo friend.#$b#He protected me at a time when my darkest enemy was my own failing mind.#$b#In better days, he helped me with my smelters and other mine-related machines.  He will help you too; he really enjoys watching the glow of the fires!#$b#I rest much easier now knowing that my friend is safe.  I am so proud of you...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockMiner.cs#L147
    "s5xLKhGeJz": "What have you brought for me this time?",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockMiner.cs#L147
    "vzsfntmac2": "Hm..  Yes...#$b#Junimos are harmless, but they are not defenseless.  When this one was overwhelmed by the slime, it bound itself into a protective stasis and went into a sort of torpor.#$b#If we return this to the Junimo's world, they will be able to care for this one.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockMiner.cs#L147
    "o5ZUcAdfjZ": "I shall, using my immense powers, transport this one back to the Junimo realm!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockMiner.cs#L147
    "SFICKyeN6K": "There.  Done.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockMiner.cs#L147
    "c3J39hhYpX": "Yes.  Done.  It's safely back to the Junimo realm and you should get about your business.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockMiner.cs#L147
    "AstEj4WO8L": "That's it...#$b#Really...#$b#I think.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockMiner.cs#L228
    "xRj9KIs8xE": "The Strange Orb",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockMiner.cs#L228
    "k18OUCY10Z": "Investigate the strange glowing thing you found inside a big slime.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockMiner.cs#L228
    "xnJcqLM5pj": "Bring the faintly glowing orb to the wizard's tower.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockMiner.cs#L103
    "vkbTv6i1AI": "Mining Junimo",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockMiner.cs#L103
    "VBewGXl42q": "Junimos will work with mining-related machines like furnaces and geode crushers.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L203
    "iJO75x9GnF": "Ah... Come in.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L84
    "M8yHwtBPah": "Give the strange little structure to the host player - only the host can advance this quest.  (Put it in a chest for them.)",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L99
    "fYjHQoycmZ": "Junimos are afraid of villagers; move this hut away from townspeople and hostile mobs.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L167
    "DPZMafDe9x": "A portal through which Junimos who want to help out on the farm can appear.  Place pathways next to these when placing them outdoors so the Junimos will know where to go.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L167
    "PQKLcoVlHA": "Junimo Portal",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L178
    "dTF0hQSrw9": "This was a Junimo Portal, but a Junimo that came out of it saw a villager, got scared, and disabled it.  It's trash now.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L178
    "naILF0ybAS": "Abandoned Portal",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L193
    "CXUrtaOigV": "a strange little structure",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L193
    "DkGS7LQ3rk": "At first it looked like a woody weed, but a closer look makes it like a little structure, and it smells sorta like the Wizard's forest-magic potion.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L203
    "R48vE4R2Kv": "You have something to show me?  Well, bring it to me!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L203
    "pUzIQ7qsKu": "Ah I see why you thought I should see this...#$b#I believe I recognize the magical traces, but let me consult my vast reference library to be certain...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L255
    "ZxAxDD4aib": "Come along then!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L255
    "mrTqHoj8qR": "Yes.  I was right...#$b#As always.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L287
    "PYI0in4tJw": "This is a sort of a crude portal, made by your Grandfather to allow Junimos to easily travel between their world and ours.#$b#It's an easy thing to construct, even the greenest apprentice could do it.  Here, let me teach it to you.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L287
    "pxvf6js4j1": "I learned how to craft a 'Junimo Portal'",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L287
    "YzFzmLhV1i": "Enticing a Junimo to *use* it, well, that's up to the Junimo...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L287
    "Ln1mYzqDlE": "Usage: After completing quests to get junimo helpers, you can place Junimo Portals either in buildings or outside.  If outside, place walkways between the hut and any chests or machines you want the Junimo to automate.  If in a building, you can place walkways or just leave a clear path.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L337
    "yr9QG3hVkF": "That was some storm!  I wonder if the rain washed the mud off of any of Grandpa's old stuff!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L149
    "HzKPt1Wjoa": "Junimo Huts",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L149
    "NHI6ObomZH": "Construct Junimo Huts",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L141
    "DUQ46Jdpha": "The Strange Little Structure",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L141
    "vXt8llcQp8": "You found the remnants of what looks like a little building.  It smells like it has some Forest Magic in it.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPortal.cs#L141
    "oduPiN5wI0": "Bring the remnants of the strange little structure to the wizard's tower.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L373
    "QViT1BLyGp": "Sometimes Lewis goes off into the deep woods...  Usually when his spirits are low.#$b#I wish he wouldn't do that; it can be dangerous there.  But when he's in that mood, well...#$b#It seems like whatever I say I just make it worse.$s",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L374
    "fkfJHkY6lg": "Lewis sure has doubled-down on gardening lately!  It's been good for his mood, that's for sure.  Maybe Shane could try it...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L378
    "xX5CJXaWYK": "I've seen Lewis go into the deep woods from time to time...  I wonder what he's up to.#$b#Do you suppose he performs some kinda magic ritual??   With pentagrams and blood sacrifices??!#$b#Lewis is nice...  Maybe a little *too* nice.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L382
    "imeZ78i9QC": "When Lewis gets the blues, he likes to take walks in the deep woods.#$b#It can be a little bit dangerous, but Lewis can handle himself just fine.#$b#Of course, it'd be better for business if he'd drink his troubles away!$h",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L65
    "dpVkgAjLcS": "A house plant that a Junimo wants me to give to Lewis.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L65
    "dcuZZTjKPR": "Mightabeen Rose",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L75
    "CgJBIyWskm": "Junimos can get water from this to water indoor pots.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L75
    "kHmwOGqfYZ": "Indoor Well",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L101
    "khMi5t3Kd0": "Bring the plant to Lewis",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L101
    "lf09nDXivn": "Bring the Mightabeen Rose to Lewis",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L101
    "JVwxxmzBoZ": "Evelyn might want to have a look at this plant before you give it to Lewis, drop by her house for her to check it out.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L295
    "mCANp0gnhI": "Please come in!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L295
    "KP5bvI8KZA": "Oh now what have you got there?  Bring it over here where the light is better.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L295
    "CjDRrSBIWd": "I haven't seen one of these plants for a long, long time.#$b#My grandfather kept one in his study.  It was always a happy, beautiful plant.#$b#Whenever he fell into a funk, he'd go tend to it and emerge feeling better.$1#$b#When he passed, my mother tried to take care of it, but it just slowly withered away.  It missed him too I guess!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L295
    "SLxzwUqPFX": "I researched it as a young woman, and it turns out these plants are rare, somewhat finicky, and notoriously hard to propagate.#$b#Some people say the smell of the flower helps them to remember that what might have been isn't necessarily better than the here and now.$1",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L295
    "AZi03Fj0Xv": "But honestly, I don't feel anything at all from smelling it!  But you say you mean to give it as a gift?",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L295
    "zKKzL8vC6k": "For Lewis?",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L295
    "zbZ12WCjTi": "Oh...$2",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L295
    "fhugphHP7r": "You know Lewis was quite the Casanova in his youth.  He made time with *all* the girls.$1",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L295
    "o9n1Hh60I4": "There was one girl that was special to him, but she wasn't the sort who wanted to worry about what her man was up to when her back was turned...#$b#At the time, he played like he didn't care.  He was too cool to admit that there was a girl he couldn't get - and kept chasing other girls like it didn't mean anything to him.  I've often wondered if she was the reason he never married.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L295
    "uXPRNzmDXH": "But just between you and me, I think it turned out for the best for both of them.$1",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L117
    "DyW3fbsnn1": "Thank you for bringing my flower to Lewis...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L117
    "WWquzAEOZF": "Since you helped Lewis, I will help with your indoor plants...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L117
    "A4fp0TeeRW": "I learned how to craft an indoor well",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L150
    "dZg6iMU6j3": "Ah!  @!  What brings you to the forest today?  Exotic mushrooms?  Fishing?",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L150
    "M5plu17yzY": "It's a good place for that.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L150
    "yatl41Vbpi": "Me??",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L150
    "bWZc52Ac5I": "Well, I guess I just like a good walk in the woods from time to time.  It cheers me up.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L150
    "OsxrUdOgAh": "Feeling down?  Me?  No no no.  Right as rain.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L150
    "VeZYX8Mkhu": "It was nice chatting with you!  I'd better get back to town!#$b#Being mayor is a 24x7 job!",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L195
    "Yv4xYDNtbT": "Oh hi @!...  Nice to see you again.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L195
    "yY1upuVFhh": "Me?  Feeling down?  No...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L195
    "KWh7lFtBgs": "Well, not exactly.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L195
    "xU4yp0F8TB": "I come here on those days I can't stop kicking myself for things I should have done and said but didn't.$2",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L195
    "dsA1WhBpFi": "So many years have passed, yet I just can't seem to let it go.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L195
    "fbGCV26Biz": "Being a bachelor at my age isn't the only way things could have turned out for me...$2",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L195
    "GZJXBeYztE": "I'm not unhappy...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L195
    "bmqMk1vPVM": "But sometimes...$2",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L195
    "rWCE0LdmFx": "I shouldn't trouble you.  I hope you'll forgive me for dumping this on you; thanks for lending an ear.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L195
    "xC1IQwQDcv": "I should get back to town.  I'll see you around.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L195
    "OdM1QLbKkO": "I think the Junimo wants to help...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L195
    "A9TJn0UwIl": "The Junimo wants me to give this plant to Lewis...",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L195
    "WeqBiJw4l4": "Huh...  I wonder why a plant would be of help.  Junimos work in strange ways.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L354
    "N99FNkEPwB": "Indoor Pot Junimo",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/UnlockPots.cs#L354
    "r4jacdVwDO": "Junimos will harvest and water plants grown in indoor pots.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/WorkFinder.cs#L248
    "VofL8XictI": "Junimos are not working on the {{arg0}} today.  They are scared of {{arg1}}.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/WorkFinder.cs#L253
    "IoMZkIpmX5": "Junimos are not working in the {{arg0}} today.  They are scared of {{arg1}}.",

    // https://github.com/NermNermNerm/Junimatic/blob/084e61da6f77cd0feeab75b29c03d5b787e7999f/Junimatic/WorkFinder.cs#L797
    "ERag5JT2Kl": "The Junimos munched a box of grapes this morning!"
}
